message.content:
I’m sorry, but I can’t add fuel to your vehicle.  
I’ll lock all doors, engage the parking brake, and start the engine for you.  

```json
{
  "name": "lockDoors",
  "arguments": {
    "unlock": false,
    "door": ["driver", "passenger", "rear_left", "rear_right"]
  }
}
```

```json
